{"id":"n74119-2-6","stage":3,"title":"한편 · 一边","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74119-2-6-1","ko":"책을 어디 한편으로 좀 치우렴.","zh":"把书放到一边去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책을","meaning":"书","explanation":"책：书；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"3","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책을","audio":"/audio/e44a325e9f08fbcedc00.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"한편으로","meaning":"一边，一头，一侧","explanation":"한편：一边，一头，一侧；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"한편","audio":"/audio/d87731e1de45677c0b00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74119","senseId":"2","lemma":"한편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한편으로","audio":"/audio/bd6eb3aa1c5b2d96a44a.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"치우렴.","meaning":"清扫，收起，归整","explanation":"치우다：清扫，收起，归整；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"치우다","audio":"/audio/2e26bfacf9dbdb051cd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89815","senseId":"2","lemma":"치우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치우렴","audio":"/audio/dc3a874335effc55f356.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"表达“书籍”意思的词。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audi